    "detailed_description": "Poor Lanna has gone to heaven following a tragic accident. Fortunately, she has the chance to come back to life. Help the kitten pass all the tests and defeat the guardians, keepers of the 3 pieces of her soul. Do you accept the challenge?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    30 game levels.<br></li><li>    Simple puzzles of increasing difficulty.<br></li><li>    Hidden shmup mini game.<br></li><li>    Unlockable challenges and difficult mode for the most skillful.<br></li><li>    Beautiful pixel art.<br></li><li>    Wonderful soundtrack inspired by Ghibli composers.</li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "Poor Lanna has gone to heaven following a tragic accident. Fortunately, she has the chance to come back to life. Help the kitten pass all the tests and defeat the guardians, keepers of the 3 pieces of her soul. Do you accept the challenge?<br><br><strong>Features</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>    30 game levels.<br></li><li>    Simple puzzles of increasing difficulty.<br></li><li>    Hidden shmup mini game.<br></li><li>    Unlockable challenges and difficult mode for the most skillful.<br></li><li>    Beautiful pixel art.<br></li><li>    Wonderful soundtrack inspired by Ghibli composers.</li></ul>",
    "short_description": "\u2018Purrs in Heaven\u2019 is a challenging platform game. Using the power of a sacred talisman, the poor Lanna can create echoes of herself to reach inaccessible platforms, solve puzzles and continue her mission to defeat the guardians of her soul.",
